{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Forget the limits of the road \u2013 in Super Flying Vroom Vroom, your car takes to the skies!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accelerate, take off, and chain together wild aerial moves in vibrant, colorful worlds. Every jump is a chance to push your speed higher, every curve an opportunity to shave precious seconds off your time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Solo mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954380/extras/b94128b63fbea630eb5c8cb6ec44e830.poster.avif?t=1772843394\" width=780 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954380/extras/b94128b63fbea630eb5c8cb6ec44e830.webm?t=1772843394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954380/extras/b94128b63fbea630eb5c8cb6ec44e830.mp4?t=1772843394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect your skills, beat your own best times, and master each track at your own pace.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Compete with friends</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954380/extras/a8987f684de0f3a8e35221cd60ba65d3.poster.avif?t=1772843394\" width=780 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954380/extras/a8987f684de0f3a8e35221cd60ba65d3.webm?t=1772843394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954380/extras/a8987f684de0f3a8e35221cd60ba65d3.mp4?t=1772843394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat your friends in a race, or challenge them to set the lowest time on any track. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create your own challenges</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954380/extras/7a49d304f4e06513af3024536aed6924.poster.avif?t=1772843394\" width=780 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954380/extras/7a49d304f4e06513af3024536aed6924.webm?t=1772843394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954380/extras/7a49d304f4e06513af3024536aed6924.mp4?t=1772843394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own tracks, and aerial playgrounds with the built-in map editor. Test them yourself or challenge the community for endless replayability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun and accessible arcade driving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flying cars and spectacular aerial parkour</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varied and colorful tracks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replay system to challenge your best times</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Map editor for limitless creativity</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3954380?t=1772843394","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3954380?t=1772843394","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954380/c51e94740bd2901b36b5ba5df89ad1132c604669/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772843394","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954380/c51e94740bd2901b36b5ba5df89ad1132c604669/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772843394","categories":[{"description":"Single-